<!DOCTYPE html>
<html xmlns:metal="http://xml.zope.org/namespaces/metal"
    xmlns:i18n="http://xml.zope.org/namespaces/i18n"
    xmlns:tal="http://xml.zope.org/namespaces/tal"
    tal:omit-tag="textual">
<head tal:omit-tag="textual">
    <title tal:omit-tag="textual">Your identity data has been erased</title>
</head>
<body tal:omit-tag="textual">
    <h1 tal:omit-tag="textual">Your identity data has been erased</h1>

    <p tal:omit-tag="textual">Hello <span tal:replace="pseudonym | nothing">Pseudonym</span>,</p>

    <p tal:omit-tag="textual">The Quarantine period following the deactivation of your account on the <span tal:replace="site_name">Site Name</span> platform of <span tal:replace="domain_name">Domain Name</span> has ended: as required by the rules of the Cooperative, your identity data has now been erased from our directory and database.</p>

    <p tal:omit-tag="textual">Only your pseudonym, the date and the reason of your departure are retained.</p>

    <p tal:omit-tag="textual">Best regards,</p>
    <p tal:omit-tag="textual">The team of <span tal:replace="domain_name">Domain Name</span></p>
    <p tal:omit-tag="textual" tal:content="organization_details">Organization details</p>
</body>
</html>
